changed their destiny drastically...\n\nA great adventure set in the World Tree.\nA few years before the day of their journey\nIn the deep forest, what is it that befalls the inexperienced boy and girl...!\n<br><br>\n(Source: YouTube)","duration":17,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":11,"year":2021},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://twitter.com/kagarihibana"},{"language":null,"site":"YouTube","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WKcNEluI_zo"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://twitter.com/kagarihibana"}],"genres":["Action","Fantasy","Romance","Supernatural"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":false,"meanScore":65,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":26,"month":11,"year":2021},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":5,"score":30},{"amount":5,"score":40},{"amount":14,"score":50},{"amount":18,"score":60},{"amount":23,"score":70},{"amount":14,"score":80},{"amount":6,"score":90},{"amount":6,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":35,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":363,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":144,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":13,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":7,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":null,"native":"カガリ ヒバナ","romaji":"Kagari Hibana"},"trailer":{"id":"JXHBL1Z8Uxc","site":"youtube"},"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793701112},"58638":{"al":176907,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":null,"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176907-YzsMqplVkGQ3.jpg"},"description":"<b>Episode 1</b><br>\n<br>\n<i>Katatsumuri</i><br>\nA track-and-field girl waits for the bus alone at a bus stop in the middle of nowhere where it rains frequently. Then a climate otaku boy appeared. The two are soaking wet and talking as comfortably as if they were taking a break. While their abnormal sexual tendencies come and go, they respond to the otaku boy's desires and accept each other's desires. Under the sky after the rain, the men and women's feelings were different, but their satisfaction levels overlapped, and there were two people who were lost in thought.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Episode 2</b><br>\n<br>\n<i>Ame no Yo ni</i><br>\nOn a rainy night when a middle aged man was desperate, a woman at a girls' bar named Aine approached him and he entered the bar, and then he started going to the bar several times. About a month later, he met a drunken Aine at a standing bar in the daytime. When he asked her about it, she told him that she was unemployed. After listening to her complaints for a long time and caring for her, they were alone together in a park restroom.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Natsu</i><br>\nThe school pool was covered with the summer sun. As a boy is cleaning it, a female student, the class president, comes to help him. When they are almost finished, the girl slips and gets drenched in the pool water. He took her hand and helped her up. She says she has something she wants to try... and the two spend a summer of youth.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Mediabank, translated)","duration":20,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Hentai"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":55,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",176906,169183,"MANGA","MANGA"],["SOURCE",176905,null,"MANGA","ONE_SHOT"],["SOURCE",176902,null,"MANGA","ONE_SHOT"],["SOURCE",176901,null,"MANGA","ONE_SHOT"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2024,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":19,"month":7,"year":2024},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":14,"score":10},{"amount":13,"score":20},{"amount":28,"score":30},{"amount":23,"score":40},{"amount":39,"score":50},{"amount":45,"score":60},{"amount":43,"score":70},{"amount":19,"score":80},{"amount":25,"score":90},{"amount":11,"score":100}],"statusDistribution